flowchart TB
  subgraph CAPTURE["1 Capture 录入"]
    direction LR
    A[登录] --> B[首页]
    B --> C[复盘今天 / 再记一笔]
    C --> D{能录音?}
    D -->|能| E[1–3 段 × 60s]
    D -->|否| F[手打]
    E --> G[Whisper]
    G --> I[转写可改]
    F --> I
  end

  subgraph STRUCT["2 Structure 抽取"]
    direction LR
    L{配额?} -->|尽| M[禁用生成]
    L -->|够| N[完成并生成 · 吸底]
    N --> N1[正在整理你说过的话]
    N1 --> O[Claude · Prompt 1.7]
    O --> P{schema OK?}
    P -->|否| Q[不展示假结果]
  end

  subgraph HITL["3 Review 人审"]
    direction LR
    S[默认三段 + 确认保存] --> S1[还可以记下]
    S1 --> T{确认?}
    T -->|否| U[Draft 不入库]
    T -->|是| V[保存]
  end

  subgraph MEM["4 Archive · Progress"]
    direction LR
    W[训练档案] --> X[反复问题]
    W --> Y[History · 术语可点]
    W --> Z[课前规则卡 / 问问档案 / 7天 / 5次]
  end

  CAPTURE --> STRUCT --> HITL --> MEM
